<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEnabledBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEnabledBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is enabled by"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEnabledBy> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEnabledBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an entity and another entity that enables it, e.g. linking an investigation to a project that enables it."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEnabledBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEnabledBy> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-endeavour a frapo:Endeavour ;\n        frapo:isEnabledBy :my-project .\n    " .
